    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is best described in 25 words: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a sci-fi roguelike auto battler where you command an intergalactic carrier, outfitting it with new spacecraft and technologies to take on other players asynchronously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If I were forced to use more words and gifs then I'd probably say something like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/d55f530c78e1a462a7ae298673987396.poster.avif?t=1747659674\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/d55f530c78e1a462a7ae298673987396.webm?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/d55f530c78e1a462a7ae298673987396.mp4?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Carrier with a wide array of deadly spaceships and weird and wonderful technology designed to obliterate anyone stupid enough to oppose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The position of cargo items can both trigger awesome combos with other cargo or combine to create entirely new technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique items means, billions of combinations - and we\u2019ve tested them all\u2026.honest, don\u2019t look into it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/835b4367c48f3b2aa0ec626f1b752e40.poster.avif?t=1747659674\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/835b4367c48f3b2aa0ec626f1b752e40.webm?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/835b4367c48f3b2aa0ec626f1b752e40.mp4?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage opposing commanders in asynchronous multiplayer - because nobody wants to actually talk to other people online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/7f8cbc5ad19634db2deb7341cc0f0168.poster.avif?t=1747659674\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/7f8cbc5ad19634db2deb7341cc0f0168.webm?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/7f8cbc5ad19634db2deb7341cc0f0168.mp4?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not the size of your deck that matters, it\u2019s also the shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Crew to uncover derelict areas of your Carrier, who knows what tech you might reveal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then put them to work flying your starships, ensuring they stay on target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/746eef02aa1f5900d38ca7195f6c625c.avif?t=1747659674\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in real life, if you can emerge victorious 10 times before tasting defeat 3 times then you are crowned \u201cawesome and better than 10 other people\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, in space, no one can hear you rage-quit, but we can see your win/loss stats!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is best described in 25 words: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a sci-fi roguelike auto battler where you command an intergalactic carrier, outfitting it with new spacecraft and technologies to take on other players asynchronously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If I were forced to use more words and gifs then I'd probably say something like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/d55f530c78e1a462a7ae298673987396.poster.avif?t=1747659674\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/d55f530c78e1a462a7ae298673987396.webm?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/d55f530c78e1a462a7ae298673987396.mp4?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Carrier with a wide array of deadly spaceships and weird and wonderful technology designed to obliterate anyone stupid enough to oppose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The position of cargo items can both trigger awesome combos with other cargo or combine to create entirely new technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique items means, billions of combinations - and we\u2019ve tested them all\u2026.honest, don\u2019t look into it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/835b4367c48f3b2aa0ec626f1b752e40.poster.avif?t=1747659674\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/835b4367c48f3b2aa0ec626f1b752e40.webm?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/835b4367c48f3b2aa0ec626f1b752e40.mp4?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage opposing commanders in asynchronous multiplayer - because nobody wants to actually talk to other people online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/7f8cbc5ad19634db2deb7341cc0f0168.poster.avif?t=1747659674\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/7f8cbc5ad19634db2deb7341cc0f0168.webm?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/7f8cbc5ad19634db2deb7341cc0f0168.mp4?t=1747659674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not the size of your deck that matters, it\u2019s also the shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Crew to uncover derelict areas of your Carrier, who knows what tech you might reveal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then put them to work flying your starships, ensuring they stay on target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/746eef02aa1f5900d38ca7195f6c625c.avif?t=1747659674\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in real life, if you can emerge victorious 10 times before tasting defeat 3 times then you are crowned \u201cawesome and better than 10 other people\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, in space, no one can hear you rage-quit, but we can see your win/loss stats!</p>",
